 .../packet/LevelChunkBiomePacketTest.java     | 147 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 148 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/test/java/net/raphimc/viabedrock/protocol/packet/LevelChunkBiomePacketTest.java

